serif'>TEST DESCRIPTION<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>RESULTS<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>UNIT<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=282 valign=top style='width:211.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Normal Range<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <td width=264 valign=top style='width:198.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=282 valign=top style='width:211.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <td width=264 valign=top style='width:198.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Vitamin D 25\r\n  Hydroxy, Serum<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>(CMIA)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ng\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=282 valign=top style='width:211.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&lt; 10\r\n  Deficiency)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>10 - 30\r\n  (Insufficiency)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>30- 100\r\n  (Sufficiency)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&gt; 100\r\n  (Toxicity)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Notes: The assay measures both D2\r\n(Ergocalciferol) and D3 (Cholecalciferol) metabolites of Vitamin D, 25 (OH) is\r\ninfluenced by sunlight, latitude, skin pigmentation, sunscreen use and hepatic\r\nfunction. Optimal calcium absorption requires vitamin D, 25 (OH) levels\r\nexceeding 75 nmol\/L. It shows seasonal variation, with values being 40-50%\r\nlower in winter than in summer. Levels vary with age and are increased in\r\npregnancy. This is the recommended test for evaluation of vitamin D\r\nintoxication.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Comments: Vitamin D\r\n(Cholecalciferol) promotes absorption of calcium and phosphorus and\r\nmineralization of bones and teeth. Deficiency in children causes Rickets and in\r\nadults leads to Osteomalacia. It can also lead to Hypocalcemia and Tetany.\r\nVitamin D status is best determined by measurement of 25 hydroxy vitamin D, as\r\nit is the major circulating form and has longer half life (2-3 weeks) than 1,25\r\nDihydroxy vitamin D (5-8hrs).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Decreased\r\nLevels: -- Inadequate exposure to sunlight<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n-- Dietary deficiency<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 --\r\nVitamin D malabsorption<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n-- Severe Hepatocellular disease<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n-- Drugs like Anticonvulsants<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0-- Nephrotic syndrome<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Increased\r\nLevels:\u00a0 -- Vitamin D intoxication<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658752;left:-62px;\r\ntop:428px;width:1041px;height:430px'><img width=833 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhEQQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAQBAIAgAAAAAAAAAJVjI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8cJENB2jd96zu9+D\/wJg8ShsYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9yttwv+isPksbmMPqvT7LW7DX8\/CwA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>VITAMIN\r\nD 25 \u2013 HYDEOXY CHOLECALCIFEROL <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=750\r\n style='margin-left:5.4pt;border-collapse:collapse'>\r\n <tr style='height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <td width=264 valign=top style='width:198.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>TEST NAME<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>RESULTS<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>UNIT<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=282 valign=top style='width:211.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>BIO. REF. INTERVAL<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <td width=264 valign=top style='width:198.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=282 valign=top style='width:211.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <td width=264 valign=top style='width:198.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>VITAMIN D\r\n  (25OH), SERUM<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Methodology :\r\n  ECLIA<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ng\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=282 valign=top style='width:211.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:55.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Deficiency\r\n  &lt;20<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Insufficiency\r\n  20 - 30<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Sufficiency 30\r\n  - 100<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Toxicity\r\n  &gt;100<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CLINICAL\r\nNOTES<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Vitamin\r\nD is essential for strong bones, because it helps the body use calcium from the\r\ndiet. Traditionally, vitamin D deficiency has been associated with rickets, a\r\ndisease in which the bone tissue doesn't properly mineralize, leading to soft\r\nbones and skeletal deformities. But increasingly, research is revealing the\r\nimportance of vitamin D in protecting against a host of health problems.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Symptoms\r\nand Health risks of vitamin D deficiency <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Symptoms\r\nof bone pain and muscle weakness can mean you have a vitamin D deficiency.\r\nHowever, for many people, the symptoms are subtle. Yet, even without symptoms,\r\ntoo little vitamin D can pose health risks. Low blood levels of the vitamin\r\nhave been associated with Increased risk of cardiovascular disease, Cognitive\r\nimpairment in older adults, Severe asthma in children &amp; Cancer.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Research\r\nsuggests that vitamin D could play a role in the prevention and treatment of a\r\nnumber of different conditions, including type1 and type 2 diabetes,\r\nhypertension, glucose intolerance, and multiple sclerosis.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Causes\r\nof vitamin D deficiency<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-Peoplle\r\nfollowing a strict vegan diet. -Exposure to sunlight is limited, <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-Vitamin\r\nD malabsorption- like Crohn's disease, cystic fibrosis, and celiac disease, <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-Dietary\r\ndeficiency <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-Severe\r\nHepatocellular disease <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-Drugs\r\nlike Anticonvulsants <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-Nephrotic\r\nsyndrome<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Increased\r\nlevels <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-Vitamin\r\nD intoxication<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.85pt 54.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}